# 216-polyline-arc-off-arc: added by the parity loop from a Fusion probe
# polyline-arc-off-arc: Line tool: line (0,0)-(20,0), tangent arc to (20,20) (CCW R10), then a tangent arc dragged off that arc's end to (10,30) (CW R10 about (20,30)), lines back: area 600+50pi-25pi, extruded 5.
{"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": {"origin": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "normal": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], "x": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0]}}
{"cmd": "sketch.line", "points": [[0, 0], [20, 0]]}
{"cmd": "sketch.arc", "tangent": 2, "start": [20, 0], "end": [20, 20]}
{"cmd": "sketch.arc", "tangent": 6, "start": [20, 20], "end": [10, 30]}
{"cmd": "sketch.line", "points": [[10, 30], [0, 30], [0, 0]]}
{"cmd": "sketch.finish"}
{"cmd": "extrude", "sketch": 1, "distance": 5, "operation": "new_body"}
